On available
    If player is karus
        Say "We're almost done. Cheer up, Master! Bros is looking for you so go find him at Ronarkland."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "End did not stay long! Come master! Looking monk Keisei Phalanx magic reveal with your Lorna greater land can not be."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "We have to hope for the best."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It's about time that the heads of the Devils are coming out. Defeat [Devil26] Bune, [Devil50] Furcas, [Devil67] Amdusias.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [26Devil] Bune, [50Devil] Furcas, and [67Devil] Amdusias."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "We have to hope for the best."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It's about time that the heads of the Devils are coming out. Defeat [Devil26] Bune, [Devil50] Furcas, [Devil67] Amdusias.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [26Devil] Bune, [50Devil] Furcas, and [67Devil] Amdusias."

On in_progress
    Say "You aren't done sealing? I'll send you once again."

On claimable
    Show quest "You've done sealing."

On completed
    Say "This time is't [Devil2] Agares. With the [Devil2 Summoning Scroll] find [Devil2 Summon Stone] here at Ronarkland. They might be"
